---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const title = 'Privacy';
const description = 'Mailbox Atlas privacy policy: no accounts, no forms, no advertising trackers.';
---
<Base title={title} description={description}>
  <h1>Privacy</h1>
  <p>Mailbox Atlas is a static website. We don't run accounts, sign-up forms, comments, advertising, or third-party tracking scripts, and we don't set cookies.</p>
  <h2>Hosting</h2>
  <p>The site is hosted on GitHub Pages. GitHub processes technical request data (such as IP address) to deliver pages and keep the service secure. See <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub's privacy statement</a>.</p>
  <h2>Links to other sites</h2>
  <p>We link to provider and USPS pages, which have their own privacy policies. If links to a provider become affiliate links, that provider may know you arrived from this site.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about this policy: <a href="mailto:ds59tmmv@mail.grokbot.com">ds59tmmv@mail.grokbot.com</a>.</p>
  <p class="meta">Effective November 19, 2026. Updated November 21, 2026 (contact added).</p>
</Base>
